mbination of fear and  anxiety every single day and you know  producing a daily news show it's not  that different for me where I wonder you  know the night before I'll review what  stories am I looking at for the next day  and then I'll wake up and sometimes the  entire show is changed because of  something Donald Trump did at 3:00 4:00  or 5:00 in the morning  my advice is number one you know this  only applies to some of the people that  are watching if you live in a blue state  with a blue legislature relatively  progressive legislature kind of like  where I am in Massachusetts other than  the Republican governor although it's  certainly a sort of decaffeinated  Republican in a sense and Charlie Baker  if you're in a progressive state you are  somewhat protected from the insanity  that is the Donald Trump administration  but that only goes so far even a lot of  state programs depend on federal funding  which Donald Trump could cut etc I think  that for people who are interested in  being activists and hopefully most  progressives are because they see what's  going on I've been on my program talking  about the really specific ways that  individuals can get involved I mean we  have two governor's races in 2017 the  midterms are not that far away the 2020  census is going to be a big part of  fixing gerrymandering which is an  absolute disaster that helps Republicans  win in the House and has for several  elections now so I think focusing on  what can be done and how to get involved  is a good way forward well David it was  a pleasure speaking to you today to  catch David daily check out the link to  his channel below you don't want to miss  it he'll keep you sane folks many of us  are aware that were in uncharted  territory most mornings I roll out of  bed and I think is this really still  happening so I turn on my phone look at  the news and I realize yeah it is so I  go back to bed again so basically my  productivity level is right up here  right now okay look I may be the only  one who's going crazy but I don't think  so I mean what do you guys think do you  think that Trump is in the right mental  state to be President of the United  States let me know comment below well  folks that's it for me  I'm math Angie and you've been watching  ride with me until next time good night  hey guys for more satire and comedy  please hit the subscribe button  you'll be glad you did or not I mean I  can't really guarantee that but what but  I'll just do it it's free I mean why not  right

